records.biography:
(a) Maintain accurate financial records;

(b) Record member contributions;

(c) Prepare financial reports;

(d) Maintain expenditure records;

(e) Keep supporting financial documentation;

(f) Provide financial information to members;

(g) Ensure that funds are handled according to approved procedures;

(h) Report financial irregularities; and

(i) Present the financial position of the group when required.
